  "description": "Compile-time typed HTTP client generation for .NET using Roslyn source generators. Add [HttpClient] to an interface and [Get]/[Post]/[Put]/[Delete]/[Patch] to methods — AutoHttpClient generates a strongly-typed HttpClient implementation at build time. AOT-safe Refit alternative. Zero reflection, zero runtime overhead.",
