  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0: Add built-in [Resilience(ResiliencePreset)] per-method policy presets (Conservative/Standard/Aggressive) that combine timeout + retry defaults without external Polly wiring; explicit [Retry] continues to override preset retry values while keeping preset timeout. 1.4.0: Add IAsyncEnumerable<T> streaming return type support (lazily deserializes a JSON array response element-by-element via JsonSerializer.DeserializeAsyncEnumerable, disposing the response/stream when enumeration ends) and a Polly-free [Retry(maxAttempts, delayMilliseconds)] attribute with exponential backoff for transient failures (ApiException 5xx/408/429 or HttpRequestException); AH007 diagnostic when [Retry] is combined with IAsyncEnumerable<T> (unsupported, ignored). Both go beyond Refit parity. 1.3.0: Add IObservable<T> return type support (closes the Refit parity gap) and a per-method [JsonSerializerOptions(providerType, memberName)] override with AH006 diagnostic for an invalid/missing provider member. 1.2.0: Static headers ([Headers]), [HeaderCollection], [QueryMap], collection query parameter expansion, multipart form uploads ([Multipart]/[Part]), ApiException with EnsureSuccessAsync error handling, and AH004/AH005 diagnostics. Zero-warning Native AOT/trim publishing: generated code now resolves JsonTypeInfo of T from JsonSerializerOptions instead of using generic reflection-capable overloads, and DI registration (AddAutoHttpClients(jsonOptions)) no longer requires trim-unsafe constructors. 1.1.0: Add OpenAPI/Swagger scaffolding tool in the repo for generating AutoHttpClient interfaces from spec documents. 1.0.1: Fix package icon (was showing an incorrect/placeholder image). 1.0.0: [HttpClient] on interface; [Get]/[Post]/[Put]/[Delete]/[Patch] methods; [Body]/[Query]/[Header] parameters; route template interpolation; AddAutoHttpClients() DI registration; AH001/AH002/AH003 diagnostics.",
